+  /// Return the widest store that store merging may create in \p MF. By
+  /// default the widest legal store; a target whose widest legal types are
+  /// not for merged stores (canMergeStoresTo refuses them) returns less, so
+  /// that the search is sized as if they did not exist.
+  virtual unsigned
+  getMaximumMergedStoreInBits(const MachineFunction &MF) const {
+    return getMaximumLegalStoreInBits();
+  }
